    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CYBER MAYDAY is a VR-exclusive 4v1 asymmetric action game set in a cyberpunk metropolis. Four survivors must complete tasks and escape while evading one powerful killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors: Use decoys and revive skills to deceive the killer while completing tasks across the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killer: Track and eliminate survivors using guns and speed boosts, plus sabotage their tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environment: Navigate a meticulously designed cyberpunk environment with vertical levels and hiding spots</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the ultimate VR cat-and-mouse game with intense, immersive action that can only be achieved in virtual reality.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CYBER MAYDAY is a VR-exclusive 4v1 asymmetric action game set in a cyberpunk metropolis. Four survivors must complete tasks and escape while evading one powerful killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors: Use decoys and revive skills to deceive the killer while completing tasks across the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killer: Track and eliminate survivors using guns and speed boosts, plus sabotage their tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environment: Navigate a meticulously designed cyberpunk environment with vertical levels and hiding spots</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the ultimate VR cat-and-mouse game with intense, immersive action that can only be achieved in virtual reality.</p>",
    "short_description": "Escape or hunt in this 4v1 VR cyberpunk thriller where survival is never guaranteed.",
